    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/a1ee5718c168510aeb506465d29856de.avif?t=1755202939\" width=650 height=922 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unleash your dragon spirit in a high-flying, co-op brawler from developers who\u2019ve contributed to iconic franchises like Spider-Man, Crash Bandicoot, and Skylanders!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by industry veterans from Beenox and Ubisoft, <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is a vibrant side-scrolling beat \u2018em up where teamwork, transformation, and over-the-top fun collide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mystical world of \u00dcna, where ancient power stirs and chaos rises. As one of eight dragon-bound champions, battle through monster-infested lands, master unique fighting styles, and transform into awe-inspiring dragons to reclaim balance. Whether you're flying solo or brawling alongside friends, prepare for a fiery showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/896302a2c00b331cab178b68f6447fc3.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>4 distinct heroes</strong> (with 4 more coming soon after launch), each infused with the soul of a dragon. Master their combat styles, build devastating combos, and unleash their dragon forms in the heat of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/f8005105897f64b29d4fc22f84db1511.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through hordes of enemies with fluid controls and dynamic attacks. Fight across colorful, hand-crafted levels in both <strong>solo</strong> and <strong>multiplayer</strong> modes. Unlock upgrades, push your skills, and face off against increasingly formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/ca11a036ddc53d7d87ae59c359783aab.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>3 players online or in local couch co-op</strong> in Adventure Mode, or challenge your friends in wild <strong>competitive brawls</strong>. Want to win? Prove your mettle by outlasting your rivals and mastering the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/4a62d06e8ecbdf84e36d0c602e4e832a.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a twist to any match with hilarious curses: <strong>shrink your opponents, flip their controls, or turn them into a frog</strong>. Disrupt their rhythm and turn the tides in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/480a1f7726b208adc52e2597ec2e5cb1.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where <strong>2D hand-drawn art</strong> is brought to life in 3D. Every realm bursts with color, depth, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/a566b2123f3086d5647213acf5044c17.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world teeters on the edge of destruction. The <strong>Celestial Dragon</strong>, last of her kind, has vanished\u2014and only the <strong>Dragon-Souls</strong>, heroes bound to her legacy, can uncover the truth and restore order. Awaken the power within. And fight to become the legend \u00dcna needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b8e06973b75d32d24fbaaf9e39001ef2.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is the debut title from <strong>RuniQ</strong>, founded by<strong> veterans from Beenox</strong>\u2014the studio behind <i>Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled</i>, <i>Spider-Man: Shattered Dimensions</i>, and <i>Skylanders</i>. With decades of combined experience and a passion for crafting memorable games, the team brings triple-A expertise to a heartfelt indie project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by prestigious accolades like the <strong>Catapulte Pitching Contest</strong> and <strong>GDC Pitch Day 2024</strong>, and supported by the <strong>Canada Media Fund</strong> and <strong>Valo-Capitale</strong>, RuniQ is forging the next big universe in action gaming. Their partnership with <strong>HMD Creations</strong> ensures the <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> IP expands far beyond the screen\u2014with books, board games, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to become a Dragon-Soul?</strong></h2><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unleash your dragon spirit in a high-flying, co-op brawler from developers who\u2019ve contributed to iconic franchises like Spider-Man, Crash Bandicoot, and Skylanders!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developed by industry veterans from Beenox and Ubisoft, <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is a vibrant side-scrolling beat \u2018em up where teamwork, transformation, and over-the-top fun collide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/7ceb5f21c7b61251a91096f594a7086f.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the mystical world of \u00dcna, where ancient power stirs and chaos rises. As one of eight dragon-bound champions, battle through monster-infested lands, master unique fighting styles, and transform into awe-inspiring dragons to reclaim balance. Whether you're flying solo or brawling alongside friends, prepare for a fiery showdown!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/896302a2c00b331cab178b68f6447fc3.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>4 distinct heroes</strong> (with 4 more coming soon after launch), each infused with the soul of a dragon. Master their combat styles, build devastating combos, and unleash their dragon forms in the heat of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/f8005105897f64b29d4fc22f84db1511.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through hordes of enemies with fluid controls and dynamic attacks. Fight across colorful, hand-crafted levels in both <strong>solo</strong> and <strong>multiplayer</strong> modes. Unlock upgrades, push your skills, and face off against increasingly formidable foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/64a1c9aa19b14808432f2e19565bd26b.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/ca11a036ddc53d7d87ae59c359783aab.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>3 players online or in local couch co-op</strong> in Adventure Mode, or challenge your friends in wild <strong>competitive brawls</strong>. Want to win? Prove your mettle by outlasting your rivals and mastering the chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/4a62d06e8ecbdf84e36d0c602e4e832a.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add a twist to any match with hilarious curses: <strong>shrink your opponents, flip their controls, or turn them into a frog</strong>. Disrupt their rhythm and turn the tides in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/89db48cd7c6769a7d3f706aa9b38d8d0.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/480a1f7726b208adc52e2597ec2e5cb1.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually striking world where <strong>2D hand-drawn art</strong> is brought to life in 3D. Every realm bursts with color, depth, and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/a566b2123f3086d5647213acf5044c17.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world teeters on the edge of destruction. The <strong>Celestial Dragon</strong>, last of her kind, has vanished\u2014and only the <strong>Dragon-Souls</strong>, heroes bound to her legacy, can uncover the truth and restore order. Awaken the power within. And fight to become the legend \u00dcna needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.poster.avif?t=1755202939\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.webm?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/1c02a2959d8cfb3980af83413c9f244f.mp4?t=1755202939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733070/extras/b8e06973b75d32d24fbaaf9e39001ef2.avif?t=1755202939\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> is the debut title from <strong>RuniQ</strong>, founded by<strong> veterans from Beenox</strong>\u2014the studio behind <i>Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled</i>, <i>Spider-Man: Shattered Dimensions</i>, and <i>Skylanders</i>. With decades of combined experience and a passion for crafting memorable games, the team brings triple-A expertise to a heartfelt indie project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backed by prestigious accolades like the <strong>Catapulte Pitching Contest</strong> and <strong>GDC Pitch Day 2024</strong>, and supported by the <strong>Canada Media Fund</strong> and <strong>Valo-Capitale</strong>, RuniQ is forging the next big universe in action gaming. Their partnership with <strong>HMD Creations</strong> ensures the <i>Heroes of Mount Dragon</i> IP expands far beyond the screen\u2014with books, board games, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you ready to become a Dragon-Soul?</strong></h2><br>",
